  "modifications": [
    "Host namespace changed to com.xyp.gtneverreset; source files are placed by GUI, rendering, input, action execution, scripting, profile storage, inventory, event, packet and loader responsibilities.",
    "Private GUI helper types are nested in their owning GUI. Client types retain side isolation.",
    "Client preferences are declared under MainConfig.client.radialMenu and registered/saved through the existing host configuration lifecycle.",
    "R opens the wheel. Profile/editor keys register through the client loader, and /radialmenu settings opens host settings.",
    "The built-in tool belt defaults to ten slots, supports 2-24 slots, and retains server-authoritative inventory operations, stack limits, item NBT, save keys and respawn behavior.",
    "Belt packets are appended to the existing NetWorkHandler channel; owner-only snapshots are applied on the client thread after connection/world checks.",
    "English and Chinese translations are generated from adjacent Java #tr comments.",
    "Upstream wheel rendering, nested rings, editor behavior, profiles and Lua scripting are retained. LuaJ is shaded and relocated by the host build.",
    "KeyBindingAccessor is registered only on the client in mixins.gtneverreset.early.json."
  ],
